Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): Bulma-inspired box, level, tag, notification
 primitives

Adopt layout ideas from Bulma without the framework dependency:
soft elevated boxes, horizontal metric levels, pill tags, status
banners, block spacing, and a soft accent button. Wired into Today
coach brief and Progress recovery.
